================================================================================
py4DSTEM (the oracle; the detector definitions are ported)
================================================================================

The detector masks (DetectorMask) are a port of py4DSTEM's
DataCubeVirtualImager.make_detector, and the virtual image, mean and maximum
pattern follow DataCube.get_virtual_image, get_dp_mean and get_dp_max
(py4DSTEM/datacube/virtualimage.py, virtualdiffraction.py at commit
f050d207851f8accd3aa550365baaf1f38230428, version 0.14.19). The pins in
Tests/CuboVirtualTests/Fixtures/slice-1-pins.json are py4DSTEM's outputs on
the synthetic cubes there, written by tools/slice-1/pins.py.

